# MAGIC <details>
# MAGIC
# MAGIC This flow shows the core idea behind Genie Agents.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC A user asks a question in plain, everyday language. No SQL, no dashboards to navigate, no need to know where the data lives.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC A Genie Agent takes that question, understands the intent, and uses your governed data to generate a response.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC That response can include queries, summaries, and visualizations.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC ### Consumers
# MAGIC - Can ask questions the same way you would ask a colleague
# MAGIC - A Genie Agent translates your question into data queries behind the scenes
# MAGIC - Results are grounded in your organization's data, not generic answers
# MAGIC - You can iterate, refine, and explore without needing technical skills
# MAGIC
# MAGIC Think of it as moving from "I need to write SQL" to "I just ask what I want to know."
# MAGIC
# MAGIC </details>

